    "Historical run conditions differ in pool, prompts, trajectories and dates. This is descriptive resource evidence, not a controlled four-versus-ten concurrency benchmark.",
    "GPU utilization measures the fraction of time kernels are active, not useful token throughput; 94% with four streams and approximately 620 tokens/s with ten streams can both be true.",
